  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\n\nI've discovered that path-to-regexp v8 [dropped](https://github.com/pillarjs/path-to-regexp/releases/tag/v8.0.0) support of `?` and `+` parameter modifiers.\nWill URLPattern spec follow this change or indicate the difference somewhere in the docs?\n\n",
